Item.ДекорацияБезОтладки.Title=Algorithms are not uploaded. The mode is convenient to use when you do not need to debug algorithms. Algorithms will run, but their code is not available for debugging.
Item.ДекорацияКакПроцедуры.Title=Algorithms are unloaded as separate procedures. When the algorithm is called, the corresponding processing procedure is accessed. See Help for limitations on using the mode.
Item.ДекорацияПоМестуВызова.Title=Algorithms are unloaded as integrated code in handlers, i.e. instead of the algorithm call string, the full algorithm code is inserted, taking into account the nested algorithms. See Help for limitations on using the mode.
