Item.ПояснениеДекорация.Title=1. After the debugging module is formed, copy the received handler code to the clipboard.\n2. Open the configurator and create a new external processing. Paste the contents of the clipboard into the processing module. Save processing.\n3. At the final fourth step, specify the newly created processing as processing with export procedures of processors.\n
